	(text "LED used to be on PC0 in v1\nPC6 is SPI MOSI, which \nallow DMA and helps us \navoid bit-banging the LED \nwith the CPU.\n\nDone in V2: Switched the LED to PC6"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
